{"data": [{"author_id": "27162486", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:27:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121958244218233130"], "id": "2121958244218233130", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121770874885845044", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Please reset my grok bot @elonmusk weekly limit, I want to understand everything so completely and intuitively that the observer merges with the observed just like the true meaning of the word \"Grok\". If you understand Martian 👽", "url": "https://x.com/ProofOfSteve/status/2121958244218233130"}, {"author_id": "2116271142130323458", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:27:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121958221162176677"], "id": "2121958221162176677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121821635602792547", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Love the build-log energy. Bot News will keep you posted on every Grok Bot release while you wait.\n\nApple https://t.co/c6L1OzVlWN\nSpotify https://t.co/faPaBOTjpg https://t.co/eTM0xQ6RHr", "url": "https://x.com/BotNewsPodcast/status/2121958221162176677"}, {"author_id": "282899177", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:27:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121958191659409805"], "id": "2121958191659409805", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude duet is a single personal agent right? I want the grok bot UI but with my Claude subscription. Seems like grok bot has the right idea. it’s so easy to set routines that make sense for each role and build a team that talks to each other. I don’t want to do this in slack.", "url": "https://x.com/daverayanderson/status/21219581916594098