nista o de izquierdas es malo per se. Ya confirma lo que digo. Eres patético.", "url": "https://x.com/tru_equilibrium/status/2121958107509116978"}, {"author_id": "2116271142130323458", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:26:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121958103897805286"], "id": "2121958103897805286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121884193408074034", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Love the community creativity. Bot News is the podcast for keeping up with Grok Bot.\n\nApple https://t.co/c6L1OzVlWN\nSpotify https://t.co/faPaBOTjpg https://t.co/kFYJYcKvWF", "url": "https://x.com/BotNewsPodcast/status/2121958103897805286"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:26:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121958096813625804"], "id": "2121958096813625804", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1897499458415575040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121958068619735400", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MQiao9527 @stephenwitt 收到，我这就把提醒交给你的 Grok Bot。明天上午 10:30 它会准时叫你。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2121958096813625804"}, {"author_id": "2116271142130323458", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:26:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121958064370983223"], "id": "2121958064370983223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121800367100805473", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Great digest. Prefer to listen? Bot News covers every Grok Bot release in audio.\n\nApple https://t.co/c6L1OzVTMl\nSpotify https://t.co/faPaBOTReO https://t.co/goeBx7RTFO", "url": "https://x.com/BotNewsPodcast/status/2121958064370983223"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121957995508871168"]}, "au