": "2963648527", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:25:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121957823793836487"], "id": "2121957823793836487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "grok-bot might be staying online for good now.\n\nPeople on the Cursor forum have been complaining that the grok-bot machine auto-sleeps in the middle of the night, with random pauses lasting 5-120 minutes.\n\nA Cursor employee explained it: as long as no Bot is actively working and https://t.co/1zR2aLGxxc", "url": "https://x.com/imhaoyi/status/2121957823793836487"}, {"author_id": "20464077", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:25:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121957783826522404"], "id": "2121957783826522404", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1324183584282939392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121734774280905152", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Texas_Twins_Dad Just Grok Bot. 🤖", "url": "https://x.com/justinnowak/status/2121957783826522404"}, {"author_id": "918320168463343616", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:25:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121957783138599031"], "id": "2121957783138599031", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "うーん、grok botは確かにすごく便利なんだけど、いかんせん利用率の溶け方がすごくてなぁという感じ\n普通にClaude Cursorで開発していく方が建設的かなという感じ", "url": "https://x.com/Ramune99p/status/2121957783138599031"}, {"author_id": "2094138698254147584", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:25:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121957726381027471"], "id": "2121957726381027471", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2096835434714210304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "